    "animation": "One continuous 3-second shot, no cuts. First, a gunshot from the unseen corridor blasts through the lock and handle with a brief flash, splinters and metal fragments flying inward. A short beat later, only Lady Pipa's heavy boot enters frame and kicks the damaged door violently open toward camera; her body and face remain completely unseen behind the wall and doorframe. The door continues swinging to motivate the next cut. Static camera, realistic recoil of the door, dust and secondary debris. Preserve exact room geometry and furniture. No visible shooter, no Van, no extra people, no morphing, no captions, logos or watermark."
